  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan first names it while reading the Swimword Gu resource flag in the plaza, where the three clans list goods against merit points.",
        "chapters": [
          132
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_swimword_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later judges that he has already accumulated enough battle merits for the exchange, but that Gu Yue Yao Ji blocked it in the dark after failing to buy his Liquor worm.",
        "chapters": [
          148
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blocked-exchange",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_yao_ji",
          "gu_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he advances to rank three, he repeats that charge to her face among the elders. The narration states that what he said was true, though she denies it aloud as slander.",
        "chapters": [
          153
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blocked-exchange",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The cited chapters never show him completing the exchange or refining the Gu.",
        "chapters": [],
